<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks moved lower at the start of trading on Thursday as investors waited for shares of IBM to open.</p>
<p>IBM is expected to open lower and drag the Dow industrials down further</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials was off 10 at 6,507, the Nasdaq Composite down two at 1,199 and the S&amp;P Index off one at 749.</p>
<p>The 30-year long bond was off 3/32 to yield 7.08 percent.</p>
